WEBVTT

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:22.088
Though you are so close,
Kore hodo soba ni

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:26.593
I cannot tell you how I feel.
Iru no ni tsutaerarezu

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:30.663
The more strongly I feel,
Tsuyoku omou hodo

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:35.268
the harder it is for me to find the words.
Kotoba ga mitsukaranai

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:43.309
What is sad is not fate...
Kanashii no wa unmei ja nakute

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:54.083
...but that all encounters come to an end.
Deai no subete ni owari ga aru koto

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:58.525
O incomplete beings,
Mikan naru mono

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:02.962
awaken, for beyond the night...
mezameyo yoru o koetara

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:07.033
At the end of the desert...
Sabaku no hate ni

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:14.701
...the truth surely awaits you.
Shinjitsu ga matteru yo kitto

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:04.989
An Afternoon in Emporium

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:12.296
This last job sure was a good one!

00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:15.468
Jobs for the lab pay well
for their level of difficulty.

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:17.670
Even after subtracting the taxes
and what goes into our savings,

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.339
it comes out to quite a profit.

00:02:19.339 --> 00:02:21.574
Maybe I'll take it easy for a while.

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:23.276
We still have considerable payments to make...

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:25.211
...on the weapons and munitions...

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:25.905
Oh.

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:28.677
I guess the poor have no leisure.

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:36.817
Once in a while, she found herself
unintentionally looking for him.

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:42.056
How long had it already been
since she and Iks had parted?

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:45.191
Honoka.

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:48.868
There's something that bothers me a little.

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:49.425
Hold on.

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:59.445
I'm picking up a faint reading
from the vibration sensor.

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:00.878
It's increasing.

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:15.453
A sandstorm?

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:17.189
These are not the sounds of a sandstorm.

00:03:17.964 --> 00:03:21.331
Animals? Scared and trying to run away?

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:25.198
Sand dragons? A herd of sand dragons?

00:03:25.471 --> 00:03:25.994
Honoka!

00:03:26.172 --> 00:03:28.003
Engine full throttle! Maximum combat speed!

00:03:41.454 --> 00:03:43.556
I'm going to cut across! Get in the PSP!

00:03:43.556 --> 00:03:46.354
It should provide more safety
than the cockpit seatbelt!

00:03:46.459 --> 00:03:47.084
Got it!

00:03:56.603 --> 00:03:57.934
Are we going to be okay?

00:03:58.204 --> 00:03:59.796
Have faith in your partner.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:01.368
I trust you.

00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:15.950
We're almost out!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.582
Everyone, I trust that we are all assembled?

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:48.354
As of now,

00:04:48.354 --> 00:04:51.448
all systems will be switched to
emergency data processing mode SS,

00:04:51.758 --> 00:04:54.056
a state of super critical emergency management.

00:04:56.095 --> 00:04:58.631
The notice to switch to
SS mode has already been sent...

00:04:58.631 --> 00:05:00.064
...to the Inspection Force terminals.

00:05:01.167 --> 00:05:02.935
Depending on how the situation progresses,

00:05:02.935 --> 00:05:07.565
SSS mode, the state of maximum
alert, may be invoked.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:08.800
What is this emergency you speak of?

00:05:09.642 --> 00:05:11.234
I will explain that to you now.

00:05:11.978 --> 00:05:13.070
If everyone would follow me...

00:05:56.389 --> 00:05:57.447
So ugly.

00:05:58.591 --> 00:06:00.393
But man, a herd of sand dragons!

00:06:00.393 --> 00:06:04.261
They say there were hundreds, no
thousands, no tens of thousands!

00:06:04.464 --> 00:06:06.833
They came really close to hitting us here, right?

00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:09.535
Yeah, the story is that they slowed down
a good distance away from town...

00:06:09.535 --> 00:06:11.404
...and disappeared somewhere.

00:06:11.404 --> 00:06:12.928
How frightening!

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.307
She was not interested.

00:06:16.042 --> 00:06:18.806
She showed no interest in anything.

00:06:19.579 --> 00:06:21.706
She did not even attempt to become involved.

00:06:31.524 --> 00:06:32.718
You taking Bogie with you?

00:06:33.192 --> 00:06:36.491
You can't do maintenance work on
intelligent machines here, right?

00:06:36.863 --> 00:06:38.731
I thought I'd take him to the hospital.

00:06:38.731 --> 00:06:41.033
There's no need for that, though.

00:06:41.033 --> 00:06:42.466
You're still saying that?

00:06:42.668 --> 00:06:45.831
You really hate hospitals, don't you?

00:06:46.272 --> 00:06:48.968
Oh, it's not hospitals you hate, but Meilin, right?

00:06:49.342 --> 00:06:51.207
That is not the issue here.

00:06:51.411 --> 00:06:52.469
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:52.645 --> 00:06:54.203
I don't really care,

00:06:54.781 --> 00:06:57.545
but how does one manage to
get ripped to shreds like this?

00:06:57.683 --> 00:07:00.117
Tell me, Miss, what the heck did you do?

00:07:00.453 --> 00:07:02.216
We cut across a herd of sand dragons.

00:07:02.622 --> 00:07:03.452
What?

00:07:09.429 --> 00:07:10.863
That's so like you, Miss!

00:07:10.863 --> 00:07:12.990
Huh? What's that supposed to mean?

00:07:13.566 --> 00:07:15.864
So? What about it? Can it be fixed?

00:07:17.103 --> 00:07:18.593
If it's just fixing it, yeah.

00:07:18.738 --> 00:07:20.763
Huh? What do you mean?

00:07:20.873 --> 00:07:22.442
To tell you the truth,

00:07:22.442 --> 00:07:25.912
I want to take it all apart once
and do a complete overhaul.

00:07:25.912 --> 00:07:27.079
But see...

00:07:27.079 --> 00:07:28.512
It'll take time?

00:07:28.681 --> 00:07:30.512
Oh, if it's money...

00:07:30.616 --> 00:07:32.015
That's not it.

00:07:32.318 --> 00:07:32.716
Huh?

00:07:33.553 --> 00:07:36.954
This is Pops'... Zankan's greatest masterpiece.

00:07:38.257 --> 00:07:40.953
I hate to say it, but with my skills...

00:07:41.694 --> 00:07:43.958
Well, I'll do the best I can.

00:07:45.665 --> 00:07:46.563
I'm counting on you.

00:07:49.068 --> 00:07:50.797
I'll have to do something about that.

00:07:51.504 --> 00:07:53.131
Joey won't do?

00:07:53.473 --> 00:07:56.374
He'll become a real top-notch
mechanic someday.

00:07:56.809 --> 00:07:58.470
He's top-notch even now.

00:07:58.578 --> 00:07:59.479
But...

00:07:59.479 --> 00:08:02.312
Still not up to replacing Zankan...

00:08:06.552 --> 00:08:07.450
Kevin!

00:08:08.788 --> 00:08:10.847
Hey, Sword Dancer.

00:08:10.923 --> 00:08:12.857
You look laid back. Out shopping?

00:08:12.959 --> 00:08:14.824
Hah! I'm working.

00:08:15.328 --> 00:08:18.531
Word is, a peculiar bunch has
made their way into town,

00:08:18.531 --> 00:08:19.930
so we're on security duty.

00:08:20.132 --> 00:08:21.599
A peculiar bunch?

00:08:21.667 --> 00:08:23.569
I don't know the specifics,

00:08:23.569 --> 00:08:26.868
but they're supposedly some
religious cult's assassination squad.

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:28.932
So it's got to do with religion...

00:08:29.709 --> 00:08:33.110
There are many religions on the frontier.

00:08:33.779 --> 00:08:34.947
Among them are groups...

00:08:34.947 --> 00:08:38.178
...that are even willing to commit
crimes in the name of their doctrine.

00:08:38.818 --> 00:08:40.586
Some people are even speculating...

00:08:40.586 --> 00:08:44.223
...that the sand dragon fuss this
morning was their doing too, but...

00:08:44.223 --> 00:08:46.526
That's shoddy work for a bunch of pros.

00:08:46.526 --> 00:08:46.890
Huh?

00:08:47.059 --> 00:08:47.260
Hey, hey, Mother, I heard today
that sand dragons are amazing!

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:49.262
Hey, hey, Mother, I heard today
that sand dragons are amazing!
This rumor's spread to the point...

00:08:49.262 --> 00:08:51.197
Hey, hey, Mother, I heard today
that sand dragons are amazing!
...where even you and I've heard it.

00:08:51.197 --> 00:08:51.330
Hey, hey, Mother, I heard today
that sand dragons are amazing!

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:52.198
Hey, hey, Mother, I heard today
that sand dragons are amazing!
So the target must have also.

00:08:52.198 --> 00:08:53.065
They can crush homes and stuff!
So the target must have also.

00:08:53.065 --> 00:08:53.666
They can crush homes and stuff!

00:08:53.666 --> 00:08:54.467
They can crush homes and stuff!
I'd say so.

00:08:54.467 --> 00:08:55.501
They can crush homes and stuff!
Or maybe that was what they wanted.

00:08:55.501 --> 00:08:57.537
And they're supposed to be tasty.
Or maybe that was what they wanted.

00:08:57.537 --> 00:08:57.970
And they're supposed to be tasty.

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:58.404
Did you know that, Mother?

00:08:58.404 --> 00:08:59.171
Did you know that, Mother?
Waiting for their target to hear the rumor...

00:08:59.171 --> 00:09:00.206
Waiting for their target to hear the rumor...

00:09:00.206 --> 00:09:02.231
...and make a move...

00:09:07.313 --> 00:09:09.975
Okay, we'll be sure to take good care of him.

00:09:10.416 --> 00:09:11.644
Where's Old Man Nor?

00:09:12.084 --> 00:09:13.786
He said he was going sand crab hunting.

00:09:13.786 --> 00:09:14.980
Sand crabs?

00:09:15.221 --> 00:09:16.789
They're apparently showing up near the city...

00:09:16.789 --> 00:09:19.257
...because of the sand dragon
commotion this morning.

00:09:19.325 --> 00:09:21.691
Wait, his office hours aren't over yet, are they?!

00:09:21.827 --> 00:09:23.727
That's why he's taken his patients with him.

00:09:25.498 --> 00:09:27.329
What a freewheeling old man.

00:09:27.867 --> 00:09:29.596
So, how long will it take?

00:09:30.303 --> 00:09:33.136
If it's just running diagnostics,
one day will be plenty.

00:09:33.339 --> 00:09:36.108
But depending on the results, we may
have to admit him to the hospital.

00:09:36.108 --> 00:09:37.075
Admit me?

00:09:37.176 --> 00:09:38.578
You must be exaggerating.

00:09:38.578 --> 00:09:41.113
Oh, what are you saying, little boy?

00:09:41.113 --> 00:09:43.716
Pardon me, but if you could
also not call me that...

00:09:43.716 --> 00:09:45.518
It's been 17 years since you were born, right?

00:09:45.518 --> 00:09:46.849
You're still just a little boy.

00:09:47.486 --> 00:09:50.080
The expression that I was
"born" is also technically...

00:09:50.823 --> 00:09:52.458
Take care of him for me, Meilin.

00:09:52.458 --> 00:09:55.586
Bogie, you be good and
listen to what Meilin says.

00:09:56.262 --> 00:09:57.194
Later.

00:09:57.964 --> 00:09:58.589
Honoka.

00:10:01.334 --> 00:10:02.130
Bogie?

00:10:02.501 --> 00:10:03.832
What is it, little boy?

00:10:04.837 --> 00:10:06.498
You're having nightmares.

00:10:06.639 --> 00:10:07.105
Huh?

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:09.235
Every night for the last three days.

00:10:09.408 --> 00:10:13.037
It hasn't been very long, so I'd just
been keeping an eye on you, but...

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:14.976
Honoka?

00:10:15.781 --> 00:10:18.079
I hadn't really noticed...

00:10:18.751 --> 00:10:20.019
Maybe you should see the Doctor...

00:10:20.019 --> 00:10:23.322
Oh, it's fine! It's really nothing.

00:10:23.322 --> 00:10:26.492
Bogie, worry about yourself rather
than worrying about others!

00:10:26.492 --> 00:10:27.754
Well, I'll be back later.

00:10:27.927 --> 00:10:29.189
Oh, Honoka!

00:10:36.168 --> 00:10:37.770
Since a couple days ago,

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:40.432
she had begun to feel an odd sensation there.

00:10:41.641 --> 00:10:45.941
It was a sense of unease that
she had never felt before.

00:10:51.083 --> 00:10:53.745
And that is the up-to-date progress report.

00:10:55.388 --> 00:10:58.118
You spoke of a space distortion field...

00:10:58.457 --> 00:10:59.549
That is correct.

00:11:00.292 --> 00:11:04.897
This spherical body does not
actually physically exist,

00:11:04.897 --> 00:11:06.999
but is nothing more than the boundary...

00:11:06.999 --> 00:11:08.534
...between our dimension and
an alternate dimension.

00:11:08.534 --> 00:11:12.197
Not only that, but various probe
devices have been swallowed up by it.

00:11:12.571 --> 00:11:14.596
Perhaps it is a type of black hole.

00:11:14.707 --> 00:11:18.973
It is not possible for something
of this sort to develop naturally.

00:11:19.311 --> 00:11:20.175
In which case...

00:11:20.713 --> 00:11:23.910
Perhaps there is a Technos Taboo
involved in this matter.

00:11:24.684 --> 00:11:26.318
Even we do not have a complete grasp...

00:11:26.318 --> 00:11:29.221
...of the technology behind space distortions.

00:11:29.221 --> 00:11:31.917
And we're to believe humans have
created that all on their own?!

00:11:32.058 --> 00:11:35.728
If so, for what purpose does
the Technos Taboo exist?

00:11:35.728 --> 00:11:39.532
To think the Inspection Force had
missed the existence of such a thing.

00:11:39.532 --> 00:11:40.931
Silence, please.

00:11:41.267 --> 00:11:42.535
On this planet,

00:11:42.535 --> 00:11:45.936
the only ones with technological
ability aside from us are humans.

00:11:46.839 --> 00:11:48.574
Since then, we established restrictions...

00:11:48.574 --> 00:11:51.210
...on the technology they
are allowed to possess...

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:54.145
...and we have continued to
monitor and enforce this.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:56.175
That is the Technos Taboo.

00:11:56.582 --> 00:11:58.311
What are you getting at?

00:11:58.384 --> 00:12:00.052
That it is impossible for mankind...

00:12:00.052 --> 00:12:03.852
...to create something of this
nature under our supervision.

00:12:04.457 --> 00:12:05.858
Just as all of you suspect,

00:12:05.858 --> 00:12:08.656
Technos Taboo has absolutely
nothing to do with this matter.

00:12:08.861 --> 00:12:10.021
Then just what is it?

00:12:11.363 --> 00:12:13.297
Please take a look at this.

00:12:35.221 --> 00:12:37.189
Hey, hey, what are you doing after this today?

00:12:37.189 --> 00:12:38.190
What am I doing?

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.214
Let's go play!

00:12:39.458 --> 00:12:40.493
Go play?

00:12:40.493 --> 00:12:42.061
My house! Come over to my house!

00:12:42.061 --> 00:12:42.789
Teacher!

00:12:43.496 --> 00:12:46.397
Hey, Teacher, wanna go catch some crabs?

00:12:46.699 --> 00:12:49.463
There's supposed to be a lot of
them showing up near town.

00:12:50.436 --> 00:12:53.372
I'm sorry. Today's not really a good day.

00:12:53.372 --> 00:12:54.066
What?

00:12:54.373 --> 00:12:56.034
Oh, okay.

00:12:56.575 --> 00:12:58.110
Well then, next time.

00:12:58.110 --> 00:12:59.600
See you later, Teacher!

00:13:05.117 --> 00:13:07.677
Maybe I'll go visit the kitty cat.

00:13:13.092 --> 00:13:17.222
She dropped by Esmel's place,
but Millie had not come home yet.

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:20.864
She could have waited there,

00:13:21.467 --> 00:13:23.560
but somehow, she was in the mood to be alone.

00:13:26.138 --> 00:13:26.695
Iks!

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:40.844
Wow, she looks sharp.

00:13:50.362 --> 00:13:53.092
Oh, welcome!

00:13:53.532 --> 00:13:54.658
Whiskey with water.

00:13:54.867 --> 00:13:56.858
It's still only early evening, Teacher.

00:13:57.503 --> 00:13:58.834
Teacher?

00:13:59.071 --> 00:14:01.437
Besides, our establishment isn't a bar...

00:14:02.107 --> 00:14:04.439
It's okay, isn't it, kitty cat?

00:14:13.419 --> 00:14:14.852
O-Okay.

00:14:22.094 --> 00:14:24.119
Hey, it's pretty empty in here!

00:14:25.197 --> 00:14:26.765
Drinks! Bring us drinks!

00:14:26.765 --> 00:14:28.357
Oh, uh, yes sir!

00:14:31.337 --> 00:14:33.862
Lady, how about you join us over here?

00:14:34.406 --> 00:14:36.533
Hey, lady. I said hey.

00:14:36.942 --> 00:14:41.003
Hey, you got a problem with that?
Come on over here.

00:14:41.914 --> 00:14:45.145
She said this establishment wasn't a bar.

00:14:45.584 --> 00:14:46.141
Huh?

00:14:46.685 --> 00:14:48.653
You people are behaving very unnaturally.

00:15:00.866 --> 00:15:03.562
H-Hold on, we're not really...

00:15:03.702 --> 00:15:06.000
When things get bothersome, I'm quick to shoot.

00:15:06.105 --> 00:15:07.936
Wasn't that in your data?

00:15:12.411 --> 00:15:15.005
We'll make trouble for kitty
cat and the others in here.

00:15:15.214 --> 00:15:15.908
What do you want to do?

00:15:16.548 --> 00:15:18.914
Will you leave? Or?

00:15:29.461 --> 00:15:30.894
Let's not do that, okay?

00:15:31.563 --> 00:15:34.896
If you're the kind of naughty boy
who shoots people in the back,

00:15:35.834 --> 00:15:37.893
I'll cut you down from behind.

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:42.537
Don't cut me down.

00:15:49.748 --> 00:15:52.216
A young woman with a sword...

00:15:52.818 --> 00:15:55.150
So you're the Sword Dancer.

00:15:55.721 --> 00:15:58.246
Your name, if I recall correctly, is Honoka.

00:15:58.757 --> 00:16:01.521
Wow, I'm famous!

00:16:06.265 --> 00:16:09.098
We'll meet again, some other day.

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:19.434
Check please.

00:16:19.545 --> 00:16:20.876
Oh, y-yes ma'am.

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:23.607
Thank you, you were a great help.

00:16:23.782 --> 00:16:27.115
He had something hidden
in his clothes, didn't he?

00:16:27.386 --> 00:16:29.411
Maybe what I did was uncalled for.

00:16:29.788 --> 00:16:30.345
How do you mean?

00:16:30.823 --> 00:16:32.984
You'd noticed him, right?

00:16:33.525 --> 00:16:35.356
And you looked like you'd
be faster than him to shoot.

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:39.932
Say, how about keeping me company for a bit?

00:16:39.932 --> 00:16:41.957
Oh, I'm no good with alcohol, so...

00:16:42.634 --> 00:16:45.432
Come on, just for a bit.

00:16:50.743 --> 00:16:52.544
I really need to go.

00:16:52.544 --> 00:16:54.307
Well, thanks for the food!

00:16:54.947 --> 00:16:56.915
She's so cool!

00:16:57.483 --> 00:17:00.680
Oh? So that's your type, kitty cat?

00:17:00.919 --> 00:17:04.218
Oh, n-no! I don't really...

00:17:12.031 --> 00:17:13.225
Honoka...

00:17:14.199 --> 00:17:15.427
Hono, huh?

00:17:20.973 --> 00:17:24.670
...they're supposedly some religious
cult's assassination squad.

00:17:25.377 --> 00:17:27.046
Some people are even speculating...

00:17:27.046 --> 00:17:29.879
...that the sand dragon fuss this
morning was their doing too, but...

00:17:31.917 --> 00:17:33.145
What a great haul!

00:17:33.285 --> 00:17:36.311
Sand crabs are tasty if you boil them.

00:17:36.655 --> 00:17:37.456
The females carrying eggs are especially...

00:17:37.456 --> 00:17:39.754
Oh, Hono!
The females carrying eggs are especially...

00:17:40.793 --> 00:17:43.195
Wow, you sure caught a bunch!

00:17:43.195 --> 00:17:45.220
Can you even eat all of these?

00:17:46.365 --> 00:17:47.593
Wanna go again tomorrow?

00:17:47.666 --> 00:17:48.155
Sure!

00:17:48.534 --> 00:17:50.399
Old Man Nor, what about your hospital?

00:17:50.569 --> 00:17:53.772
I don't have many years left to live.
I have to enjoy them!

00:17:53.772 --> 00:17:56.764
How long are these "not many
years" gonna go on for?

00:17:56.942 --> 00:17:58.204
That's a secret!

00:17:59.478 --> 00:18:02.777
Millie, I heard you're going to school?

00:18:02.981 --> 00:18:03.816
Is it fun?

00:18:03.816 --> 00:18:06.250
Yeah! I've made lots of friends.

00:18:06.385 --> 00:18:09.320
And there's this interesting teacher.

00:18:09.521 --> 00:18:11.853
Teacher? Like how?

00:18:12.224 --> 00:18:14.426
She's actually the teacher in the nurse's room.

00:18:14.426 --> 00:18:16.917
She's different, but she's a nice person.

00:18:17.463 --> 00:18:20.728
I think maybe she's a little like you.

00:18:20.966 --> 00:18:21.796
Like me?

00:18:22.634 --> 00:18:25.831
Millie's going to study lots at school.

00:18:25.971 --> 00:18:28.337
And then... And then...

00:18:28.774 --> 00:18:30.298
I'm going to become a mechanic!

00:18:31.743 --> 00:18:34.246
If I become a mechanic like my father,

00:18:34.246 --> 00:18:37.044
I can work together with you, see?

00:18:38.717 --> 00:18:39.649
Millie...

00:18:40.786 --> 00:18:44.347
So I'm going to study lots and lots!

00:18:47.526 --> 00:18:49.858
Millie sure is a tough girl.

00:18:50.395 --> 00:18:51.054
Yeah.

00:18:51.563 --> 00:18:54.293
Though, being too tough can also be worrisome.

00:19:03.809 --> 00:19:06.539
Oh, you're with the Administration Bureau.

00:19:06.812 --> 00:19:09.303
Long time no see, Honoka.

00:19:10.549 --> 00:19:13.245
Here is an old map of this location.

00:19:13.652 --> 00:19:16.416
From roughly a year before the Great War ended.

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:21.059
The position we believe to be
the center of the distortion field,

00:19:21.059 --> 00:19:23.896
records show, was the target
of a large-scale air strike...

00:19:23.896 --> 00:19:25.625
...one year before the end of the war.

00:19:25.998 --> 00:19:29.957
The destructive power was such
that it altered the very terrain.

00:19:30.702 --> 00:19:34.039
They feared what was being built here...

00:19:34.039 --> 00:19:35.768
...and made a concerted effort to destroy it.

00:19:36.608 --> 00:19:38.544
If that thing had survived,

00:19:38.544 --> 00:19:42.247
it's possible the Great War may
have ended even earlier.

00:19:42.247 --> 00:19:45.478
In an even more disastrous manner
than what we know today.

00:19:46.385 --> 00:19:48.615
What was this weapon that
was being created there?

00:19:49.388 --> 00:19:51.290
An ultimate weapon equipped...

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:54.259
...with mankind's first space distortion device.

00:19:55.527 --> 00:19:57.495
Gravestone.

00:19:58.730 --> 00:20:02.496
I am Ingrid, Chief Administrator of the
Emporium Administration Bureau.

00:20:02.868 --> 00:20:05.996
So you're Honoka. We've never met.

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:09.236
No, we haven't.

00:20:10.609 --> 00:20:12.474
I will ask you point blank.

00:20:13.111 --> 00:20:15.579
I heard you encountered the
sand dragon stampede?

00:20:15.681 --> 00:20:17.410
You have quick ears.

00:20:17.716 --> 00:20:19.013
It's part of my job.

00:20:19.351 --> 00:20:21.853
The Administration Bureau is currently
putting all its resources...

00:20:21.853 --> 00:20:24.720
...into collecting information
regarding that incident.

00:20:25.390 --> 00:20:27.756
I'd like to hear the various details
of that situation from you, too.

00:20:28.427 --> 00:20:29.228
I understand.

00:20:29.228 --> 00:20:31.992
And I would also like to hire you.

00:20:32.798 --> 00:20:34.833
Nothing untoward happened this time,

00:20:34.833 --> 00:20:37.495
but we do not know when something
similar may happen again.

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:41.206
Sand dragons are mysterious creatures,

00:20:41.206 --> 00:20:42.673
whose lifecycle is still unknown.

00:20:42.841 --> 00:20:45.110
It seems doubtful that
humans can control them,

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:46.702
but we cannot deny the possibility.

00:20:47.579 --> 00:20:49.479
Are you aware of the sand dragon's nest?

00:20:50.816 --> 00:20:52.884
It's in the southeastern
part of the Rokugo Desert,

00:20:52.884 --> 00:20:55.454
right about midway between
Emporium and Lutwik Town,

00:20:55.454 --> 00:20:56.512
is what I've heard.

00:20:56.822 --> 00:20:58.949
But that's just based on rumors...

00:20:59.291 --> 00:21:00.892
Wait, you don't mean...

00:21:00.892 --> 00:21:02.261
I would like you to go there...

00:21:02.261 --> 00:21:05.196
...and pinpoint the cause of
the sand dragon stampede.

00:21:05.697 --> 00:21:07.688
That is the job I have for you.

00:21:09.568 --> 00:21:13.334
In the last 3 days, it has clearly
begun to expand more quickly.

00:21:13.805 --> 00:21:14.873
At this rate,

00:21:14.873 --> 00:21:18.110
it is probably only a matter of time
before it swallows up nearby towns.

00:21:18.110 --> 00:21:20.579
There is also a confirmed case
of a sand dragon stampede,

00:21:20.579 --> 00:21:21.747
but could it be...

00:21:21.747 --> 00:21:24.079
It seems their nest was near the target.

00:21:24.349 --> 00:21:26.715
And what of the human towns?

00:21:26.918 --> 00:21:29.512
The closest is Lutwik.

00:21:29.688 --> 00:21:31.212
Beyond that is Emporium.

00:21:32.057 --> 00:21:35.823
Lutwik will be gone in 8 days.
Emporium will be swallowed in 10.

00:21:36.395 --> 00:21:39.455
And if it continues to expand even after that,

00:21:39.865 --> 00:21:40.832
in time...

00:21:45.037 --> 00:21:47.939
A flexible civilization...
Juunan na bunmei wa

00:21:47.939 --> 00:21:50.442
...is always rapidly advancing.
Itsudatte nisshin-geppo

00:21:50.442 --> 00:21:53.412
You and your dreams are also...
Kimi to yume mo

00:21:53.412 --> 00:21:57.212
...making headway even now.
Genzai shinkou

00:22:02.754 --> 00:22:05.724
I realized for the first time...
Hajimete kizuitan da

00:22:05.724 --> 00:22:09.421
...with that line, resembling a surprise attack.
Fui-uchi ni nita sono serifu de

00:22:14.466 --> 00:22:17.402
My sixth sense was pried open.
Kojiakerareta dai-rokkan

00:22:17.402 --> 00:22:21.429
I'd been waiting for this feeling this whole time.
Kono kankaku o zutto matteita

00:22:25.444 --> 00:22:28.413
Opening my heart, just opening it...
Kokoro o hiraite tada hiraite

00:22:28.413 --> 00:22:31.383
I embrace the voices of strangers.
Daisansha no koe ukeireru

00:22:31.383 --> 00:22:34.252
Earnestly persevering, just persevering...
Hitasura koraete tada koraete

00:22:34.252 --> 00:22:37.346
I even try turning pages of criticism.
Hinan no peeji mo aketemiru

00:22:37.656 --> 00:22:40.625
I'm going to leave my...
Toushindai no boku wa

00:22:40.625 --> 00:22:43.492
...true-to-life self behind, right here.
Koko ni oite iku yo

00:22:43.562 --> 00:22:47.366
You can say whatever you want now...
Mou nanto itte kuretemo

00:22:47.366 --> 00:22:48.890
...and I'm fine with that.
Kekkou da

00:22:49.401 --> 00:22:54.873
Ah, how simple is the impulse to evolve.
Aa nante tanjun da shinka shitai to iu shoudou

00:22:54.873 --> 00:22:57.809
You and your dreams are also...
Kimi to yume mo

00:22:57.809 --> 00:23:01.006
...making headway even now.
Genzai shinkou

00:23:15.127 --> 00:23:16.856
Preview

00:23:16.995 --> 00:23:20.098
We did not yet know that
some enormous thing...

00:23:20.098 --> 00:23:21.963
...was beginning to swallow up the world.

00:23:22.267 --> 00:23:23.735
We just went out into the desert...

00:23:23.735 --> 00:23:26.371
...to investigate what caused
the sand dragon stampede.

00:23:26.371 --> 00:23:27.668
That was all.

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:30.108
That was where she showed up.

00:23:30.509 --> 00:23:33.612
Contrary to her claim that
she came to be my partner,

00:23:33.612 --> 00:23:35.409
she's utterly irresponsible.

00:23:35.881 --> 00:23:37.212
Her name is...

00:23:37.949 --> 00:23:41.214
Next time on
The Third - The Girl With The Blue Eye,

00:23:41.286 --> 00:23:42.020
episode 9, "Paife".

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:43.321
Paife
episode 9, "Paife".

00:23:43.321 --> 00:23:44.879
Paife
